ader-Loop.gif?resize=1024%2C576&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18565\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Futures-Pro-Header-Loop.gif?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Futures-Pro-Header-Loop.gif?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Futures-Pro-Header-Loop.gif?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Futures-Pro-Header-Loop.gif?resize=178%2C100&amp;ssl=1 178w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are excited to announce that futures trading is now available in our new <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> web interface. With this upgrade, we are providing an all-in-one crypto experience that unlocks powerful trading opportunities for our clients.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro web users can now leverage the capital efficiency of futures to gain long and short exposure, trade without holding the underlying asset, and develop more advanced strategies across spot and perpetual futures markets.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro currently supports up to 95 USD linear perpetual futures. Get started today!<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/kraken-futures-goes-pro-cta-1\/\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2400\" height=\"800\" data-attachment-id=\"18492\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-asset-2-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?fit=2400%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2400,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Start trading Futures on Kraken Pro\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?fit=1024%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=2400%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Start trading Futures on Kraken Pro sign up\" class=\"wp-image-18492\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?w=2400&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=300%2C100&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=1024%2C341&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=768%2C256&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=1536%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=2048%2C683&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-2-1.png?resize=200%2C67&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The journey<\/span><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our first futures trading platform <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/futures.kraken.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">futures.kraken.com<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> raised the standard for crypto futures trading when it launched in 2020.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Recognizing the importance of futures across a breadth of trading strategies, we embedded all the advanced functionality of futures.kraken.com in the intuitive and dynamic user experience of Kraken Pro.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By empowering you to manage all your crypto trading activity \u2014 including spot, margin, staking, and now futures \u2014 from a unified interface, we believe that Kraken Pro has once again set the industry standard.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1296\" data-attachment-id=\"18495\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-asset-4-2-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?fit=2400%2C1296&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2400,1296\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Asset 4-2 (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?fit=1024%2C553&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=2400%2C1296&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Kraken Derivatives goes Pro blog image\" class=\"wp-image-18495\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?w=2400&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=300%2C162&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=1024%2C553&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=768%2C415&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=1536%2C829&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=2048%2C1106&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-2-1.png?resize=185%2C100&amp;ssl=1 185w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why trade futures with Kraken Pro?<\/span><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With futures <\/span><b>taker fees as low as 0.01%<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, Kraken Pro offers some of the lowest futures trading fees in the industry.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From a unified interface, you can seamlessly transfer more than 15 assets from your Spot Wallet into your Futures wallet to use as collateral for trading various perpetual markets without having to own the underlying cryptocurrency.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Futures-Promo-Model-Version-Preview.mov\"><\/video><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For example, you might be holding ETH in your Spot Wallet and want to take advantage of price changes in DOT without having to own DOT. You can transfer your ETH from your Spot to Futures Wallet and open a DOT position via the DOT perpetual future. Futures on Kraken Pro allows you to realize potential profits into your preferred currency, thereby enabling more adaptive trading strategies and efficient portfolio management.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With a constantly growing selection of now over <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/4844359082772-Linear-Multi-Collateral-Perpetual-Contract-Specifications\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">95 USD cross-margined perpetual futures <\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and ability to trade with leverage, you can use the all-in-one functionality of Kraken Pro to manage your spot and futures portfolios.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro&#8217;s integrated futures trading experience offers:<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quick and seamless transitions between spot and futures markets<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Easy management of spot and futures positions and collateral from a unified interface<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An intuitive portfolio view that charts historical performance across your balances<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Convenient tracking of your futures balance on the go with the Kraken Pro app<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trading analytics to view time series of open interest and perpetual funding rates<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/futures-on-pro-sign-up-cta-2\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trade Futures on Pro<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Opening the door to sophisticated <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">trading opportunities<\/span><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Futures trading with Kraken Pro allows you to be more capital efficient with the use of leverage \u2014 enabling you to maintain larger positions with a smaller initial margin requirement.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Futures trading may also allow you to benefit from cost-efficient <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/trading\/hedging-strategies\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">hedging<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. By managing both spot and futures execution, position management, and portfolio in one interface, Kraken Pro makes it easier to minimize execution expenses and potential tax liabilities while still effectively managing risk exposure.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finally, integrating futures trading within Kraken Pro makes it easier for you to execute futures basis trading strategies. By exploiting the delta between spot and futures price, you can capture <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/trading\/crypto-arbitrage\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">arbitrage<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> opportunities from funding rate discrepancies using Kraken Pro.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br><\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These examples highlight how Kraken Pro allows you to spot signals, take actions, and manage risks from a single, consolidated interface.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1200\" data-attachment-id=\"18498\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-asset-4-1-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?fit=2400%2C1200&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2400,1200\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Kraken Derivatives on Pro interface image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=2400%2C1200&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Kraken Derivatives on Pro interface image\" class=\"wp-image-18498\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?w=2400&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=1536%2C768&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=2048%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-4-1-1.png?resize=200%2C100&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to get started<\/span><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360023786632-Kraken-Futures-eligibility\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">located in an eligible jurisdiction with Intermediate Tier (3) verification or above<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you can easily start trading futures on Kraken Pro.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After opening Kraken Pro, select \u201cFutures\u201d from the market selector and choose one of the many perpetual markets that are offered. By clicking \u201cUnlock\u201d within the futures order form, you can activate futures after accepting the terms and conditions. <\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1200\" data-attachment-id=\"18500\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-asset-3-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?fit=2400%2C1200&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2400,1200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Asset 3 (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=2400%2C1200&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18500\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?w=2400&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=1536%2C768&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=2048%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Blog-Asset-3-1.png?resize=200%2C100&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please note that futures trading on Kraken Pro only supports the Multi-Collateral wallet at this time. Kraken Derivatives clients who wish to trade Single-Collateral futures can continue using futures.kraken.com for the time being.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legacy futures.kraken.com clients can simply sign in to Kraken Pro using your current login information. All account information will automatically reflect your current Multi-Collateral trading activity and past trading history. Balances in a Holding Wallet or Single-Collateral Wallet are not accessible from Kraken Pro and can only be accessed from futures.kraken.com at this time. <\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/futures-on-pro-sign-up-cta-3\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A helping hand<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To help you get up to speed with the powerful functionality of Kraken Pro, we&#8217;ve created a range of resources that will support your futures trading.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We have:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/btc-usd?dialog=tour\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">intro walkthrough video<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, providing a step-by-step guide to the new Kraken Pro platform and newly integrated futures trading<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Updated support articles to help you get started with Kraken Pro and understand the new features and functionalities, including:<\/span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/13943398868116-How-to-unlock-futures-trading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to unlock futures trading<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/13943832515860-Transferring-funds-to-your-futures-wallet\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transferring funds to your futures wallet<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/13944617482900-Futures-order-types\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Futures order types<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/13943473750292-Placing-a-futures-trade\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Placing a futures trade<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/215601908\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">24\/7 support<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, ensuring that you have the help and support you need to make a smooth transition to Kraken Pro<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you new to all the possibilities trading futures offers? Check out our Kraken Learn Center article<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/trading\/futures-trading\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> What are crypto futures contracts?<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to get started.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The future of Kraken Pro<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We&#8217;re committed to providing an unrivaled trading experience. The integration of futures trading within Kraken Pro is a significant milestone on our mission to deliver on that objective.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As you start trading futures on Kraken Pro, we welcome your valuable feedback as we continue to introduce the improvements you need.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get started with Kraken Pro today and stay tuned for many more updates coming this year!<\/span><\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #5d45dc; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/futures-on-pro-sign-up-cta-4\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign up for Kraken Pro<\/a><\/div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<div><hr>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Geographic restrictions apply.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trading futures, derivatives and other instruments using leverage involves an element of risk and may not be suitable for everyone. Read <\/span><\/i><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360022629052-Risk-Disclosure\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken\u2019s risk disclosure<\/span><\/i><\/a><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to learn more.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are excited to announce that futures trading is now available in our new Kraken Pro web interface. With this upgrade, we are providing an all-in-one crypto experience that unlocks powerful trading opportunities for our clients. Kraken Pro web users can now leverage the capital efficiency of futures to gain long and short exposure, trade [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089380,"featured_media":18513,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tie