C700&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/22172","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/120066484"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=22172"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/22172\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22483,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/22172\/revisions\/22483"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/22170"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=22172"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=22172"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=22172"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=22172"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":22175,"date":"2023-05-10T12:49:39","date_gmt":"2023-05-10T16:49:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/congress"},"modified":"2023-06-12T12:20:08","modified_gmt":"2023-06-12T16:20:08","slug":"congress","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/congress","title":{"rendered":"Kraken testifies before Congress to push for effective crypto regulation"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Today at 9:30am EST, Kraken&#8217;s Chief Legal Officer Marco Santori will appear before the U.S. House of Representatives in a landmark joint hearing entitled &#8220;The Future of Digital Assets: Closing the Regulatory Gaps in the Digital Asset Ecosystem.&#8221;<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;Advocating for the potential, and benefits, of crypto asset technology is central to our mission. We are working in partnership with lawmakers in the U.S., and other jurisdictions we operate in, to help facilitate workable frameworks for digital assets to thrive,&#8221; said Santori. &#8220;Forcing this emerging technology and growing global asset class into existing U.S. securities rules without modifications simply does not work.&#8221;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this live testimony, Santori will explain how the status quo in the U.S. is untenable for crypto companies and fails to adequately protect consumers. He\u2019ll also outline why now is the time for U.S. legislators to enact an effective regulatory framework, and will make the case for U.S. regulators to work with counterparts in other developed and emerging economies to create a coherent global framework for our markets.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>More details about the hearing can be found on the U.S. House of Representatives <a href=\"https:\/\/financialservices.house.gov\/calendar\/eventsingle.aspx?EventID=408754\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">landing page<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>You can watch the hearing live on the Subcommittee&#8217;s YouTube channel at 9:30am EST:<\/p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/i43Ckphd9vo?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"><\/iframe><\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Today at 9:30am EST, Kraken&#8217;s Chief Legal Officer Marco Santori will appear before the U.S. House of Representatives in a landmark joint hearing entitled &#8220;The Future of Digital Assets: Closing the Regulatory Gaps in the Digital Asset Ecosystem.&#8221; &#8220;Advocating for the potential, and benefits, of crypto asset technology is central to our mission. We are [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":22190,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1774],"tags":[1715,1392],"language":[],"class_list":["post-22175","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news","tag-news","tag-regulation"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kraken testifies before Congress to push for effective crypto regulation - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/congress\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kraken testifies before Congress to push for effective crypto regulation\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Today at 9:30am EST, Kraken&#8217;s Chief Legal Officer Marco Santori will appear before the U.S. House of Representatives in a landmark joint hearing entitled &#8220;The Future of Digital Assets: Closing the Regulatory Gaps in the Digital Asset Ecosystem.&#8221; &#8220;Advocating for the potential, and benefits, of crypto asset technology is central to our mission. We are [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/congress\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-05-10T16:49:39+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-06-12T16:20:08+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Blog-150dpi-21.webp?fit=1459%2C729&ssl=1\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1459\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"729\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/webp\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"krakenfx\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"krakenfx\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"1 minute\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/congress#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/congress\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"krakenfx\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/461b7fbe1832d96cab8eb182c6642a21\"},\"headline\":\"Kraken testifies before Congress to push for effective crypto regulation\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-05-10T16:49:39+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-06-12T16:20:08+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\/congress\"},\"wordCount\":229,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/news\\\